    <string name="setup_help">PEHLI DAFA SETUP:\n\n1. Phone ki Settings → About phone kholen.\n\n2. “Build number” par 7 dafa tap karen. PIN mangay to enter karen. Developer Options ON ho jayega.\n\n3. Is app mein “Open Developer Options” button dabayen.\n\n4. Developer Options mein “Select mock location app” ya “Mock location app” dhoonden.\n\n5. List se “NrLS” select karen.\n\n6. App mein wapas aakar “Start Location” dabayen aur permissions Allow karen. Notification chalti rehni chahiye.\n\n7. Asli GPS wapas lane ke liye “Stop Location” dabayen.\n\nSamsung/Xiaomi/Oppo mein menu ka naam ya jagah thori mukhtalif ho sakti hai.</string>
